WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 12h: Lunatic Pandora passes through Esthar
Duration: ~15 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Esthar at night. Looking up through the city canyon, pink energy rails arc between teal towers, a blue starburst crowns the central building.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Daytime. A massive dark rectangular monolith rises above the teal buildings, dwarfing the city skyline.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Lunatic Pandora towers overhead, its dark crystal surface blocking the blue sky as it passes through Esthar.
